{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c7af52c0-a43d-86b7-9ad9-90af4b86f2d8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:19:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, City of Newport Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:16:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Miss Whitcomb. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Peggy Gallagher. I am calling about a parking ticket that I received, and I do not agree with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:16:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, Ms. Gallagher. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number, or your license plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it here. The number is, um, one, four, four, seven, two, nine. And the plate I can give you also, if you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One four four seven two nine. Let me pull that up. [pause] Yes, I see it. It was issued Friday for parking within the restricted distance of a fire hydrant. Is that the one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is the one. But I am sorry, this is not correct. The car was not so close to the hydrant. I measured it myself, with the tape, when I saw the ticket. It was more than the distance, I am sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. The officer's notes list it as within the restricted distance. If you wish to contest it, there's a process for that, and it would be reviewed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I want to contest. But first, please, the officer took a photograph, no? I saw him with the phone. I would like to see this photograph before I say anything more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the record. [pause] There is a photo attached to the citation, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Can you send it to me by email? I think it is the easiest for me. I do not have the time to come to City Hall in the daytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can arrange that. I'll need an email address to send it to. Please spell it slowly for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It is P as in Peter, E, G, G, Y, then the dot, then Gallagher, G-A-L-L-A-G-H-E-R, at the, um, [line breaks up] at the mail dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you cut out for a moment. Was the last part \"at mail dot com\" or \"at gmail dot com\"?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, the signal is not good today. It is G-mail. G, M, A, I, L, dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So that's Peggy, dot, Gallagher, at gmail dot com. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:18:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Thank you very much. And please, how long will it take? Because I am waiting also for a call, you see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request today. It may take a business day or two for it to go out. Is there something time-sensitive about the call you're waiting for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:18:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, it is not about the city. I have a ham radio, and I am waiting for a contact, a man in another country who said he would come on the air this morning. So I must keep my phone free. That is why I ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:19:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Well, I won't keep you long. Just so you know, the ticket has a due date printed on it, and a contest request needs to be made within that window. Please don't let it pass while you wait for the photo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. It is the fifteen days, I think? I will read the ticket again. It is a pity, because I always park carefully. This is very annoying for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, Ms. Gallagher. Once you have the photo, you can decide how to proceed. The instructions for requesting a hearing are on the back of the citation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will look at the back. Then I will wait for the email. Thank you for your help, Miss Whitcomb. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good day, Ms. Gallagher."
    }
  ],
